# Docker build context is the REPO ROOT (see frontend/Dockerfile), so this file
# must live here. A .dockerignore inside frontend/ is NOT read for a root-context
# build, which previously let host node_modules leak into the image and broke
# `pnpm install` with ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY.

# Never ship host-built dependency trees. pnpm's node_modules is full of
# absolute symlinks into the host store and is invalid inside the image.
**/node_modules

# Build outputs are regenerated inside the image.
**/dist
frontend/dist

# Secrets must never enter the build context or an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem

# VCS, editor and OS noise.
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.cursor
.claude
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md

# Docs and local-only material, irrelevant to the runtime image.
Documentation
CDPI-Pass-Vault
**/*.md
!frontend/package.json

# Test/tooling caches
**/coverage
**/.rtk
**/npm-debug.log
**/pnpm-debug.log
backend/**/__pycache__
